      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Ollama (local, defaut)\n     ollama/llama3  :11434\n     SOUVERAIN — zéro clé\n\n2. OpenRouter\n     gpt-4o-mini (cheap+fiable)\n     kimi, nemotron...\n     Clé : OPENROUTER_API_KEY\n\n3. Groq\n     llama3-70b (gratuit)\n     Clé : GROQ_API_KEY\n\n4. Anthropic / OpenAI\n     Clés optionnelles",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Ollama (local, defaut)\n     ollama/llama3  :11434\n     SOUVERAIN — zéro clé\n\n2. OpenRouter\n     gpt-4o-mini (cheap+fiable)\n     kimi, nemotron...\n     Clé : OPENROUTER_API_KEY\n\n3. Groq\n     llama3-70b (gratuit)\n     Clé : GROQ_API_KEY\n\n4. Anthropic / OpenAI\n     Clés optionnelles",
      "lineHeight": 1.35
